以上～108％未満</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1.1</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 3.75pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">98%以上～103％未満</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 0.75pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom;