cing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">1-7 have skill&nbsp;GEOVN<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"><h4 class="ant-typography css-dev-only-do-not-override-k7429z" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px !important; font-weight: bold; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 20px; color: rgb(0, 114, 64); word-break: break-word; line-height: 1.4; padding-bottom: 5px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">参考<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">■専門スキル評価の計算方法について</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">スキル評価は、各評価項目あたり25点（【難易度】５×【評価】５）満点を基準とする</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度の高いレベルを選択し、高評価であれば高得点となる</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度が低いレベルを選択する場合は、評価項目数に応じ得点割合を調整する</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度が低くても一定数の評価項目数があれば、100点満点ベース換算となっていく</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">＝＝＝＝＝【条件】＝＝＝＝＝</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度５の場合は、100満点ベース</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度4の場合は、80点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">（6項目以上：100点ベース／4項目以上：90点ベース／2項目以上：85点ベース／1項目：維持）</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度3の場合は、60点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">（8項目以上：100点ベース／6項目以上：90点ベース／4項目以上：80点ベース／2項目以上：70点ベース／1項目：維持）</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度2の場合は、40点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">（10項目以上：100点ベース／8項目以上：80点ベース／6項目以上：70点ベース／4項目以上：60点ベース／2項目以上</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">　：50点ベース／1項目：維持）</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">難易度1の場合は、20点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">（12項目以上：100点ベース／10項目以上：90点ベース／8項目以上：70点ベース／6項目以上：60点ベース／4項目以上</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">　：40点ベース／2項目以上：30点ベース／1項目：維持）</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none;">■行動情意評価の等級別の具体的な判断事例について</span><br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"><table style="box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1801px;"><tbody style="box-sizing: border-box;"><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);">1等級<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; line-height: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;">５<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">極めて優秀<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></span><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; line-height: 1; vertical-align: top; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;">４<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">優秀</span></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;">３<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">標準</span></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;">２<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">やや劣る</span></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;">１<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">劣る</span></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px; text-align: center; vertical-align: top; line-height: 1; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 10px;">０<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">かなり劣る</span></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">経営ビジョン<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">方針理解</td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">企業理念、ミッションを深く理解し、自身の仕事で実践し他の模範として、職場内で高い評価を得ていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">企業理念、ミッションを熟知し、自身の仕事で一部実践するなど、時に他の模範的行動を取っていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">企業理念、ミッションを理解し、自身の仕事において意識しながら実践することができていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">企業理念、ミッションについて理解が浅く、意識した行動に結びつかないことがあった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">企業理念、ミッションを殆ど理解しておらず、そういった行動にも結びつかなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">企業理念、ミッションとは相反する行動が見られることがしばしばあった。<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">報告・連絡・相談<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">必要な報告・連絡・相談を良いタイミングで、正確かつ明瞭に実施でき、周囲にも良い影響を及ぼしていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">必要な報告・連絡・相談を、正確かつ明瞭に実施でき、周囲にも良い影響を及ぼすことがあった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">報告・連絡・相談を、正確に分かりやすい表現で実施することができていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">必要な報告・連絡・相談を行う意識があったが、適切でないことが見受けられた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">報告・連絡・相談を行う意識が乏しい、または意識はあるがその方法が適切でないことがしばしば見受けられた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">自発的に報告・連絡・相談を殆ど行うことがない。または、全く行っていなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">表現<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">相手が意図を十分に理解できるよう、必要情報を明瞭かつ分りやすい表現で伝達することができており、他の模範となっている<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">相手が理解できるように分りやすい表現で伝達することができており、業務進行が円滑であった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">相手に理解できるように表現しており、業務に支障をきたすことはなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">努力はしているが、相手に対して意図を十分に伝えられず誤解を招くことがあった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">たまに意味不明の言動があり、相手を困惑させたり不機嫌にさせることがあった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">正しく表現ができない、または表現しようとする意識がない<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">工夫<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">いつも全社的な観点から改善や提案を行っており、その着眼点や創造力より、他者から一目置かれていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">仕事を効果的に行うための工夫や改善を織り込みながら仕事を進めていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">現状に満足することなく、日常の仕事の中で自分なりに工夫改善を行っていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">同じことの繰り返しで、仕事がマンネリ化しているが、それが普通だと思っていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">今の仕事に変化を求めず、他から指摘を受けると不満な態度を取っていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">工夫もせず、他の者の工夫を否定ばかりしていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">変革行動<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">仕事の目的や内容をいち早くつかみ、的確な改善提案をし、上司を感心させていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">仕事の内容を良く理解し、改善提案することで上司を満足させていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自分の仕事の役割や内容は一応理解しており、改善提案を行うこともあった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">改善提案をすることもあるが、仕事の内容を理解しておらず、的外れであった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">業務改善ではなく、仕事への不満をよく口にしていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">全く感じられなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">向上心・自己啓発<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">何事にも主体的に取り組み、他にも良い影響を与えていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">常に高い意欲を持って、積極的に行動していた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">常に積極的な行動を心がけていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">積極姿勢に欠けることがあった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">常に受身な姿勢でしか行動できていなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">積極性が感じられなく、改善もみられなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">5Sの徹底<br style="box-sizing: border-box;">（整理・整頓・清掃・清潔・しつけ）</td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">他の模範となる努力を続けていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">高い自己管理力を持ち、信頼されていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">一通り問題はなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自己管理に不安が感じられた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自己管理が不十分であった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">再三指導したが改善されなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">勤怠</td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">他の模範となる努力を続けていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">高い自己管理力を持ち、信頼されていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">一通り問題はなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自己管理に不安が感じられた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自己管理が不十分であった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">再三指導したが改善されなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">勤務態度<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">他の模範となる努力を続けていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">高い自己管理力を持ち、信頼されていた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">一通り問題はなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自己管理に不安が感じられた<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px;">自己管理が不十分であった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.156px;">再三指導したが改善されなかった<br style="box-sizing: border-box;"></td></tr></tbody></table><table style="box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.88); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; width: 1801px;"><tbody style="box-sizing: border-box;"><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218);"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); padding: 3px; width: 257.141px; text-align: center; background-color: rgb(255, 242, 204);">2等級</td><td 