></tr></tbody></table></div><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">注）売上／粗利／営利以外の達成率については達成率のレンジ（指標）は調整可能</span></p><br style="box-sizing: border-box;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">■障害発生率などの抑制を目標とする評価基準</span></p><div dir="ltr" align="left" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-left: 0pt;"><table style="box-sizing: border-box; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;"><colgroup style="box-sizing: border-box;"><col width="193" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><col width="72" style="box-sizing: border-box;"></colgroup><tbody style="box-sizing: border-box;"><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 6.29626pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">評価指標</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">係数</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 0pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">0%～1%未満</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1.2</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 10.7963pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1%～1.5%未満</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1.1</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 17.25pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1.5%～3％未満</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">1</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 17.25pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">3%～5%未満</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">0.9</span></p></td></tr><tr style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid rgb(218, 218, 218); height: 17.25pt;"><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">5%超過</span></p></td><td style="box-sizing: border-box; border: 0.5pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 2pt; vertical-align: bottom; overflow: hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word;"><p dir="ltr" style="box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-top: 0pt; line-height: 1.38; text-align: center;"><span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">0.8</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></strong><br><br><br>	スキル評価は、各評価項目あたり25点（【難易度】５×【評価】５）満点を基準とする<br>難易度の高いレベルを選択し、高評価であれば高得点となる<br>難易度が低いレベルを選択する場合は、評価項目数に応じ得点割合を調整する<br>難易度が低くても一定数の評価項目数があれば、100点満点ベース換算となっていく<br><br>（条件）<br>難易度５の場合は、100満点ベース<br>難易度4の場合は、80点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める（6項目以上：100点ベース／4項目以上：90点ベース／2項目以上：85点ベース／1項目：維持）<br>難易度3の場合は、60点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める（8項目以上：100点ベース／6項目以上：90点ベース／4項目以上：80点ベース／2項目以上：70点ベース／1項目：維持）<br>難易度2の場合は、40点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める（10項目以上：100点ベース／8項目以上：80点ベース／6項目以上：70点ベース／4項目以上：60点ベース／2項目以上：50点ベース／1項目：維持）<br>難易度1の場合は、20点ベースとなるが、評価項目数によりベースを高める（12項目以上：100点ベース／10項目以上：90点ベース／8項目以上：70点ベース／6項目以上：60点ベース／4項目以上：40点ベース／2項目以上：30点ベース／1項目：維持）	\N	2024/5/21 11:05	2024-04-23 00:35:42.817+00	2024-07-26 01:04:38.02+00	GNW
5	2	2	0	3	\N	部門評価係数の上限を設定	<strong style="font-weight:normal;" id="docs-internal-guid-363a01d9-7fff-4063-26a6-9f22ef893f00">    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">■期中発生した追加目標および事項（考慮項目）の加算ポイント<br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">S=部署評価係数⇒＋0.1ポイント<br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">A=部署評価係数⇒＋0.05ポイント<br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">B=部署評価係数⇒+0.01ポイント</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">C=部署評価係数⇒0ポイント<br>D=部署評価係数⇒-0.05ポイント</span></p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    &nbsp;&nbsp;<p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.4; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">■個人評価（参照基準）</span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;"><br>部署評価【1.2上限】＝個人評価【S】<br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">部署評価【1.1以上】＝個人評価【A】<br>部署評価【1.0以上】＝個人評価【B】<br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">部署評価【0.9以上】＝個人評価【C】<br></span><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">部署評価【0.8以上】＝個人評価【D】</span></p>\n</strong>	<strong style="font-weight:normal;" id="docs-internal-guid-363a01d9-7fff-4063-26a6-9f22ef893f00">\n    <p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.3; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">参考とする部署評価水準）<br></span></p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<div dir="ltr" style="margin-left: 0pt; line-height: 1.3;" align="left"><span style="font-size:11pt;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;">■売上／粗利／営利などの達成率の評価水準</span>\n      